<title>FINLAND: FINNISH PT SEES FIVE PCT GDP GROWTH IN 1997.</title>
<headline>FINNISH PT SEES FIVE PCT GDP GROWTH IN 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Labour Economic Research</p>
<p>Institute (PT) said on Monday it expected Finnish gross economic</p>
<p>product to increase five percent this year.</p>
<p>Key figures in PT's new forecast:</p>
<p>				 1997	1998	1996</p>
<p> GDP			     +5	+3.5	+3.3</p>
<p> Imports			 +8	  +7	+4.5</p>
<p> Exports			 +7	  +6	+3.8</p>
<p> Private consumption	 +4	+3.5	+3.3</p>
<p> Investment		   +10	+6.5	+5.5</p>
<p> C/A (bln markka)	   +16	 +21     +19.2</p>
<p> CPI			   +1.0  about +2	+0.6</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	14.3	13.3	15.7</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
